// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mr. G 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3902314633" "Mr. G"
// ProfessionString :
"P1810970129" "Advisor"
// DescriptionString :
"P632031367" "Mr. G was known to be an enigmatic man within the government of Praetoria. However, the collapse of Praetoria caused the plans within plans that he had to fall apart. His true identity as Doppelganger was revealed, along with his plans to create a clone army.<br><br>Now, he is in the Rogue Isles, seeking to help villains with their own plots in the hopes of building back up a base of power in Primal Earth."
// LocationString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2494638543" "Terribly sorry {HeroName}, but I have nothing for you at the moment."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P659885465" "I have some things specifically in mind for you, {HeroName}.  Specifically in mind.  However, you will need to be Security Level {Level} before I can entrust these tasks to you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P726640359" "I believe the path you've taken doesn't suit our goals, {HeroName}. Let's speak again if you've had a change of heart, yes, let us indeed speak again."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2883093199" "The Transmuter will be able to move your fame and power forward with your very own group of Powers Division. It should prove very interesting. Very interesting indeed."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1133253874" "I think you'll get along very well with the man from Powers Division, very well."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P799934329" "There's a couple of people you should talk to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - RegularTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Flashback Text :
"P2059678266" "Let's begin, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1984122306" "Ask about available missions"
// Answer Text :
"P1792194317" "Ask about store"
// Answer Text :
"P2617602787" "Ask about contact"
// Page GoneMrG Text :
"P1024471603" "<color orange>Mr. G is not picking up his phone.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1122387698" "(Play Wu Yin's Personal Story)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasks 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MrGAlive Text :
"P1301263472" "I believe we've taken care of everything, {HeroName}. We shall do what we can on our own from here on out. Should you need us again, you may contact us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page MrGAlive Text :
"P3110142728" "It appears you have more pressing matters to attend to, {HeroName}. Much more pressing matters."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


