// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2105401776" "Sgt. Schorr"
// ProfessionString :
"P2781993356" "Wyvern Field Operative"
// DescriptionString :
"P3936927570" "Sgt. Byron Schorr is in charge of the Hammers of Justice, a division of Wyvern that leverages reforming villains by appealing to their weak spot: their wallets. The Hammers are paid well to use their villainous connections in order to bring down some of the most notorious figures in the Rogue Isles."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P348369441" "Seems that you've changed since we first met. <color orange>This contact is for VIP characters of the Rogue alignment only.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1783132697" "Good Day, Hammer"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3978056253" "We shouldn't be talking"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2760860570" "Greetings. I am Sgt. Byron Schorr of Wyvern, and we're setting up a new experimental group of individuals like yourself. We're called the Hammers of Justice and I've assembled a group of converting villains who still have useful contacts here in the Rogue Isles. Your specific talents are the last piece of the puzzle."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1231486623" "Wyvern is still going over the data, but after that last bit, I am not sure we'll be reactivating the Hammers anytime soon."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P664761613" "I need you to clear off some of your unfinished missions before we can proceed."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P79761519" "I don't have anything for you right now."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


