// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Vivacious_Verandi 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vivacious Verandi 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2136406225" "Vivacious Verandi"
// ProfessionString :
"P3764413622" "Carnival Mistress"
// DescriptionString :
"P2183555952" "Vivacious Verandi's always had everything she asked for. As a relative of the Verandi family, she's been spoiled since her very first years. Her access to wealth and her impeccable fashion sense soon made her a target of the Carnival of Shadows, and she's been under their thumb for many months now. It's hard to say how much of Viv's personality still remains, and how much of her has been replaced by the will of the Carnival Mistress. She still receives protection from the Family, but many of her connections to their business dealings have been cut off. Still, she has some pull in the Rogue Isles, and she can get enough info to support the Carnival's favorite pastime: making mischief."
// HelloString :
"P638577844" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey there, cutie.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4020547549" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's get up to some mischief.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1592620990" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You're looking feisty today.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3454294329" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's be bad together.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P193304565" "I don't know you, but I think I'd like to. For now, though, you should be talking to a broker. Build your relationship with them, and we could be up to all sorts of mischief in no time!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3161364333" "Hey there. I've had my eye on you for a while. If you want to party with me, you're going to have to do some bad, bad things. You up for it?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2808451004" "Our time together is over, {VillainName}. But we'll always have St. Martial."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1332341549" "Are you two timing me, {VillainName}? It looks like you're already booked!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1695485141" "If you want to get closer to me, you're going to have to get to Threat Level {Level}? Think you can do that, sweetie?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P651473769" "I can feel us getting closer day by day. This is definitely the beginning of something special. You should call me. And, you should check out my new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2474825018" "I've never felt so in touch with someone before. So free! So alive! You and I have a world of evil to explore together, {VillainName}. Take my hand. Let's plunge in! You'll need the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4180279053" "It's over, {VillainName}. But I'll always remember the sweetness we shared."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3238482152" "You should look up Vivacious Verandi. She's a relative of the Verandis, but lately she spends most of her time hanging out with the Carnival. She's interested in everything St. Martial has to offer, and she can afford to pay you well. Viv has access to Mutant and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3202043133" "Choose Vivacious Verandi"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4055096302" "Viv is a frisky girl. Be wary of her."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1937078252" "I've got a close <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</a> I'd like to introduce you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2086840666" "I've got some close <A HREF={ACCEPT}>friends</a> I'd like to introduce you to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

